---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Aminu Abdusalam"
  description="The longer story: Nigeria, Fisk, Microsoft, product, engineering, data, and the interests outside the job title."
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The longer story</p>
        <h1>I have always felt most energized in the middle.</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-note">
        <p>
          Between product and engineering. Between data and decisions. Between the system as
          designed and what customers actually experience.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="operating">
    <div class="container operating-grid">
      <div class="portrait-card" aria-label="A typographic portrait of Aminu">
        <span class="portrait-mark">A</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Ota → Nashville → Redmond</strong>
          <small>Still learning. Still building.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="operating-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">How I operate</p>
        <h2>Product manager by title. Product engineer in practice.</h2>
        <p>
          I am a Product Manager 2 at Microsoft on Consumer Commerce, an engineer who writes
          production code, and a builder who cannot stop tinkering. I am energized by ambiguous,
          high-stakes problems where product judgment and hands-on engineering can turn one-off
          pain into reusable tools, integrations, and platform capabilities.
        </p>
        <p>
          At Microsoft, that has meant shipping commerce experiences, developing data scripts
          when automated systems failed, building MCP-based Copilot CLI plugins, and contributing
          code to the tools and pipelines behind customer support and subscription launches.
        </p>
        <div class="skill-cloud" aria-label="Technical skills">
          <span>Python</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>C#</span><span>KQL</span>
          <span>MCP</span><span>Tool calling</span><span>Angular</span><span>.NET</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="journey">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">The path here</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading">A few chapters, so far.</h2>
      <ol class="timeline">
        <li>
          <span class="year">Now</span>
          <div class="chapter">
            <p>Microsoft · Consumer Commerce</p>
            <h3>Product Manager 2</h3>
            <p>Broader ownership across subscription, purchase, fraud, and applied AI work. Three promotions in under three years.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="chapter-number">04</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="year">2023</span>
          <div class="chapter">
            <p>Microsoft · Consumer Commerce</p>
            <h3>Product Manager</h3>
            <p>Joined full-time after interning and began shipping customer-facing commerce experiences at global scale.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="chapter-number">03</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="year">2023</span>
          <div class="chapter">
            <p>Fisk University · Nashville</p>
            <h3>Valedictorian, B.S. Computer Science</h3>
            <p>4.0 GPA, W.E.B. Du Bois Honors, CS Club president, teaching assistant, and an honors thesis on extended reality in mental-health therapy.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="chapter-number">02</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="year">Nigeria</span>
          <div class="chapter">
            <p>The first chapter</p>
            <h3>Curiosity before credentials</h3>
            <p>Growing up across cultures taught me to translate between perspectives long before I learned to translate between product and engineering.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="chapter-number">01</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="proud">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">A few things I am proud of</p>
          <h2 class="section-heading">Wins are better with context.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-copy">The goal is not a trophy wall. These are moments that shaped how I work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="proud-grid">
        <article class="proud-card card-fisk">
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Valedictorian at Fisk</h3>
          <p>Class of 2023, 4.0 GPA, and the W.E.B. Du Bois Honors track.</p>
          <a href="https://www.fisk.edu/about/administration/division-of-academic-affairs/academic-achievement/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fisk record ↗</a>
        </article>
        <article class="proud-card card-nfl">
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>NFL Battle of the Brains champion</h3>
          <p>Led Fisk's team through a national HBCU case competition focused on Gen Z fan engagement.</p>
          <a href="https://www.fisk.edu/university-news-and-publications/fisk-universitys-team-wins-the-highly-coveted-2022-hbcu-battle-of-the-brains/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the story ↗</a>
        </article>
        <article class="proud-card card-maki">
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Lilly HBCU Hackathon winner</h3>
          <p>Built MAKI, an NLP assistant for classifying safety narratives in patient case notes.</p>
          <a href="https://devpost.com/software/project-name-170gfn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See the project ↗</a>
        </article>
        <article class="proud-card card-thesis">
          <span>04</span>
          <h3>Published honors thesis</h3>
          <p>Explored the role of extended reality in the future of mental-health therapy.</p>
          <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22669588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the thesis ↗</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="outside">
    <div class="container outside-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Outside the work</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading">The person doing the building matters too.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="interest-list">
        <div><span>01</span><p>Spending time with people I care about</p></div>
        <div><span>02</span><p>Soccer, bouldering, pickleball, and paddleboarding</p></div>
        <div><span>03</span><p>Mentoring students breaking into tech</p></div>
        <div><span>04</span><p>Writing about product, engineering, identity, and life</p></div>
        <div><span>05</span><p>Building tools for problems I cannot stop thinking about</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-strip">
    <div class="container contact-inner">
      <h2>Want to compare notes?</h2>
      <div>
        <a class="pill-link" href="mailto:aminu0abdusalam@gmail.com">Email me</a>
        <a class="pill-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aminuabdusalam/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding-block: var(--space-12);
  }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 0.75fr;
    gap: var(--space-10);
    align-items: end;
  }
  .about-hero h1 {
    max-width: 11ch;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 9vw, 8rem);
    line-height: 0.92;
  }
  .hero-note {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
  }
  .operating {
    background: var(--color-ink);
    color: white;
  }
  .operating-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: var(--space-10);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .portrait-card {
    min-height: 540px;
    padding: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-text-strong);
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 49.8%, rgba(16, 19, 17, 0.14) 50%, transparent 50.2%),
      linear-gradient(transparent 49.8%, rgba(16, 19, 17, 0.14) 50%, transparent 50.2%),
      var(--color-green-soft);
    background-size: 48px 48px;
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--color-border-strong);
  }
  .portrait-mark {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 15rem;
    line-height: 0.8;
  }
  .portrait-card div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .portrait-card small {
    margin-top: var(--space-1);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  .operating-copy h2 {
    max-width: 14ch;
    margin-block: var(--space-3) var(--space-5);
    color: white;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
  }
  .operating .eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-green-soft);
  }
  .operating .eyebrow::before {
    background: var(--color-green-soft);
  }
  .operating-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    color: #b8c4be;
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
  }
  .skill-cloud {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
  }
  .skill-cloud span {
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: #c7d0cb;
  }
  .timeline {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }
  .timeline li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 8rem 1fr auto;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    padding-block: var(--space-6);
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .year,
  .chapter > p:first-child,
  .chapter-number {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .chapter h3 {
    margin-block: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-2xl);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .chapter > p:last-child {
    max-width: 65ch;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .chapter-number {
    font-size: var(--fs-3xl);
    color: var(--color-border-strong);
  }
  .section-intro {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }
  .proud-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-5);
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }
  .proud-card {
    min-height: 330px;
    padding: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-strong);
  }
  .proud-card > span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .proud-card h3 {
    max-width: 12ch;
    margin-top: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-2xl);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .proud-card p {
    margin-block: var(--space-3);
    color: rgba(20, 33, 29, 0.72);
  }
  .proud-card a {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
  }
  .card-fisk { background: var(--color-gold-soft); }
  .card-nfl { background: var(--color-blue-soft); }
  .card-maki { background: var(--color-bg-hover); }
  .card-thesis { background: var(--color-green-soft); }
  .outside {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }
  .outside-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: var(--space-10);
  }
  .interest-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }
  .interest-list div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding-block: var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .interest-list span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
  }
  .interest-list p {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
  }
  .contact-strip {
    padding-top: var(--space-5);
  }
  .contact-inner {
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--color-green-soft);
  }
  .contact-inner h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-3xl);
  }
  .contact-inner > div {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .hero-grid,
    .operating-grid,
    .outside-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .section-intro {
      align-items: start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .portrait-card {
      min-height: 420px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-hero h1 {
      font-size: 4rem;
    }
    .timeline li {
      grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr;
    }
    .chapter-number {
      display: none;
    }
    .proud-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .contact-inner {
      align-items: start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
